+# Deploy buwiz.com
+
+Ready to deploy. This file does not change production DNS and
+`scripts/deploy.sh` does not deploy unless a human sets
+`BUWIZ_DEPLOY_CONFIRM=deploy-buwiz-com`.
+
+`codeitlikemiley/tox` could not be cloned (GitHub: repository not found), so
+there is no existing Fermyon app id or SpinKube manifest to copy. This app
+is a static fileserver (`spin.toml`). Deploy it as its **own** Fermyon Cloud
+app or its **own** SpinKube namespace. Do not attach it to the apps that
+serve the other goldcoders.dev hosts.
+
+## DNS (do not apply until approved)
+
+| Name | Type | Value |
+|------|------|--------|
+| `www.buwiz.com` | CNAME | `<site-app>.fermyon.app` |
+| `buwiz.com` | ALIAS / ANAME | `<site-app>.fermyon.app` |
+
+`<site-app>` is the name Fermyon assigns to **this** app, not the
+buwiz-server app. Apex DNS cannot be a standard CNAME; use the registrar's
+ALIAS, ANAME, or CNAME flattening. Add both names as custom domains and let
+the platform issue the certificates.
+
+`account.buwiz.com` and `api.buwiz.com` belong to buwiz-server. Their records
+are in that repo's `DEPLOY.md`. Do not point them here.
+
+## Command
+
+```bash
+scripts/deploy.sh
+```
+
+A real deploy, after the confirmation variable is set:
+
+```bash
+spin cloud deploy
+```
+
+No secrets. No database. No Redis.
