+# buwiz.com
+
+Marketing site for [buwiz.com](https://buwiz.com). It is a static Spin app.
+It does not hold accounts or a database.
+
+## Why this is a new site
+
+`buwiz.com` was described as a Spin app inside
+[codeitlikemiley/tox](https://github.com/codeitlikemiley/tox). That
+repository was not readable from the environment that prepared this import:
+`git clone` and the GitHub API both returned **repository not found**. No
+path was extracted, and this tree does not guess what that site contained.
+The other goldcoders.dev Spin services were left where they are.
+
+This repository is the standalone marketing app. Account pages and the API
+stay in [hexuria/buwiz-server](https://github.com/hexuria/buwiz-server).
+
+## Hostnames
+
+| Host | App |
+|------|-----|
+| `https://buwiz.com`, `https://www.buwiz.com` | This site |
+| `https://account.buwiz.com` | buwiz-server Leptos UI (login, device approval, passkeys) |
+| `https://api.buwiz.com` | The same buwiz-server process, for bearer clients |
+
+The desktop app is [hexuria/buwiz-forms](https://github.com/hexuria/buwiz-forms).
+Download links on the home page go to its GitHub releases. Sign-in goes to
+`https://account.buwiz.com/login`.
+
+## Run locally
+
+Requires [Spin](https://developer.fermyon.com/spin/v2/install) 2 or newer
+(this manifest is `spin_manifest_version = 2`; buwiz-server's host is Spin
+4.2).
+
+```bash
+spin up --listen 127.0.0.1:3010
+```
+
+Open `http://127.0.0.1:3010/`.
+
+## Deploy
+
+See [DEPLOY.md](DEPLOY.md). `scripts/deploy.sh` only prints the plan unless
+`BUWIZ_DEPLOY_CONFIRM=deploy-buwiz-com`. Do not point this app at the Spin
+apps that serve other goldcoders.dev hosts.
