+      <a class="mark" href="/">Buwiz</a>
+      <nav>
+        <a href="https://github.com/hexuria/buwiz-forms/releases">Download</a>
+        <a href="https://account.buwiz.com/login">Sign in</a>
+      </nav>
+    </header>
+    <main>
+      <p class="kicker">Desktop app for Philippine BIR returns</p>
+      <h1>Prepare the return on your computer. File it from there.</h1>
+      <p class="lead">
+        eBIRForms is the Buwiz desktop app. Profiles, drafts, and the filing
+        queue stay on the machine. A Buwiz account is optional: it backs up
+        tax profiles and shares them with a firm. It is not required to
+        prepare or file a return.
+      </p>
+      <div class="actions">
+        <a class="primary" href="https://github.com/hexuria/buwiz-forms/releases"
+          >Download for macOS, Linux, and Windows</a
+        >
+        <a class="secondary" href="https://account.buwiz.com/login">Sign in</a>
+      </div>
+      <p class="note">
+        Releases are published on
+        <a href="https://github.com/hexuria/buwiz-forms/releases">hexuria/buwiz-forms</a>.
+        The app signs in through your browser at
+        <a href="https://account.buwiz.com/login">account.buwiz.com</a>.
+        Programs call <a href="https://api.buwiz.com">api.buwiz.com</a>.
+      </p>
+      <section class="grid">
+        <article>
+          <h2>On this computer</h2>
+          <p>
+            Install the app, keep the taxpayer profile locally, and use
+            dry-run when you are testing. Nothing on this website submits a
+            return to BIR.
+          </p>
+        </article>
+        <article>
+          <h2>Account</h2>
+          <p>
+            Sign-in, device approval, and passkeys live on
+            <a href="https://account.buwiz.com">account.buwiz.com</a>. The
+            desktop app opens that page in your browser. It does not ask you
+            to type the account password into the app.
+          </p>
+        </article>
+        <article>
